#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Rebuild your installed T3 Code Nightly (Linux AppImage or macOS app) with a stats bar under the composer.

Run it after every T3 Code update. Everything happens on this machine: the
patches in this repo are applied to the exact upstream commit your app was
built from, the web, server and desktop bundles are rebuilt, and the result is
laid over a copy of your app. Your T3 data is never modified; on Linux neither is your
AppImage. On macOS, `update` also installs newer T3 Code releases the way T3's own updater
does (same feed, same download, same signature check), because the customized copy cannot.
"""
